                                "html": "<div class='sacred-phil-wrap'><div class='sacred-grid-bg'></div><div class='sacred-phil-grid'><div class='sacred-phil-text-col reveal'><div class='sacred-phil-icon'><i class='fas fa-wind'></i></div><h2 class='sacred-phil-title'>Why we practice<br><span class='accent'>doing nothing.</span></h2><p class='sacred-phil-body'>Stillness isn't the absence of motion; it's the concentration of clarity. We live in an age that commodifies our attention, leaving us fragmented and fatigued.</p><p class='sacred-phil-body'>Our offerings are designed as architectural interventions for the nervous system—spaces where the debris of modern life can finally settle.</p></div><div class='sacred-phil-img-col'><div class='sacred-phil-img-wrap curtain-reveal reveal'><img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518837695005-2083093ee35b?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop' alt='Philosophy' /><div class='curtain'></div></div><div class='sacred-phil-accent-box reveal reveal-delay-1'></div></div></div></div><style>.sacred-phil-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; padding: 0 24px; }.sacred-grid-bg { position: absolute; inset: -128px 0; background-image: radial-gradient(#688F9D 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 40px 40px; opacity: 0.1; z-index: 0; }.sacred-phil-grid { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 96px; align-items: center; }@media (max-width: 1023px) { .sacred-phil-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 64px; } }.sacred-phil-icon { width: 80px; height: 96px; border: 1px solid rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.1); border-radius: 99px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #D9E8EB; margin-bottom: 48px; color: #688F9D; font-size: 32px; }.sacred-phil-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.25; color: #0E1B30; margin-bottom: 32px; font-weight: 500; }.sacred-phil-title .accent { color: #688F9D; }.sacred-phil-body { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; color: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.6); line-height: 1.625; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 300; }.sacred-phil-img-col { position: relative; }.sacred-phil-img-wrap { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/5; border-radius: 2rem; overflow: hidden; }.sacred-phil-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 4s cubic-bezier(0.1, 0, 0.3, 1); }.sacred-phil-img-wrap:hover img { transform: scale(1.1); }.sacred-phil-accent-box { position: absolute; bottom: -32px; left: -32px; width: 192px; height: 192px; background: #688F9D; border-radius: 1.5rem; z-index: -1; }.curtain-reveal { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }.curtain { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: #1D3152; transform: translateX(0); transition: transform 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.175, 1); z-index: 2; }.curtain-reveal:hover .curtain { transform: translateX(101%); }.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); animation: revealFadeUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards; }.reveal-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }@keyframes revealFadeUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }</style>"
